  # in order to:
  #  1. Check that the imputation model runs without errors
  #  2. Measure runtime for a small job
  #  3. Use that runtime to estimate how long the FULL imputation will take

# The total runtime of MICE is approximately proportional to:
#     number of imputations (m) X number of iterations (maxit)
#
# Therefore:
#     test runtime -> scaled up -> estimated full runtime

# Define test vs full imputation parameters
